    <fr:title text="DBSP">DBSP</fr:title>
    <fr:taxon>Term</fr:taxon>
  </fr:frontmatter>
  <fr:mainmatter>
    <html:p>DBSP is a language for “describing computations over data streams.” It is defined in <fr:link href="/budiu-2022-dbsp/" title="DBSP: Automatic Incremental View Maintenance for Rich Query Languages" uri="https://manual.geolog.sgai.uk/budiu-2022-dbsp/" display-uri="budiu-2022-dbsp" type="local">DBSP: Automatic Incremental View Maintenance for Rich Query Languages</fr:link>, and currently implemented in <fr:link href="/feldera/" title="Feldera" uri="https://manual.geolog.sgai.uk/feldera/" display-uri="feldera" type="local">Feldera</fr:link>.</html:p>
  </fr:mainmatter>
